  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.62,
      "end": 3.7,
      "text": "If you are a business owner,"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.7,
      "end": 5.66,
      "text": "listen to me very carefully"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.66,
      "end": 8.78,
      "text": "because I am gonna show you right now"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.78,
      "end": 12.98,
      "text": "how to never pay any taxes"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.98,
      "end": 17.46,
      "text": "on your business income ever again."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.46,
      "end": 19.22,
      "text": "What you need to do"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.22,
      "end": 22.62,
      "text": "is you need to set up a private trust,"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.62,
      "end": 24.9,
      "text": "not just any private trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.9,
      "end": 28.9,
      "text": "It needs to be non-grant or irrevocable"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.9,
      "end": 30.7,
      "text": "and spend thrift."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.7,
      "end": 32.3,
      "text": "Non-grant or just means"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.3,
      "end": 35.14,
      "text": "that there is no owner of the trust, okay?"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.14,
      "end": 36.74,
      "text": "When a trust is created,"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.74,
      "end": 38.26,
      "text": "you have a grantor,"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.26,
      "end": 39.26,
      "text": "you have a trustee"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.26,
      "end": 41.18,
      "text": "and then you have your beneficiaries."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.18,
      "end": 43.54,
      "text": "The grantor is the owner."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.54,
      "end": 45.74,
      "text": "Listen folks,"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.74,
      "end": 50.86,
      "text": "the whole financial system revolves around ownership."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.09,
      "end": 55.89,
      "text": "Ownership is the only way you can be sued for something,"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.89,
      "end": 56.73,
      "text": "right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.73,
      "end": 57.69,
      "text": "If I sue you in court,"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.69,
      "end": 61.87,
      "text": "I can only go after things that you own."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.87,
      "end": 63.75,
      "text": "So it's very important to understand"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.75,
      "end": 66.92,
      "text": "that when you own a business,"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.92,
      "end": 71.6,
      "text": "you are still receiving personal income."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.6,
      "end": 73.86,
      "text": "Go read the tax code,"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.86,
      "end": 76.02,
      "text": "personal income"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.02,
      "end": 79.22,
      "text": "or any income that you receive,"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.22,
      "end": 80.9,
      "text": "meaning you own the income."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.9,
      "end": 82.66,
      "text": "You're the W-2 employee,"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.66,
      "end": 84.58,
      "text": "you're the owner of the LLC."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.58,
      "end": 89.26,
      "text": "Anytime that you receive income to your name,"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.26,
      "end": 90.78,
      "text": "the ego, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.78,
      "end": 92.26,
      "text": "The fake person,"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.26,
      "end": 94.14,
      "text": "the straw man, whatever the fuck you wanna call it,"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.14,
      "end": 96.92,
      "text": "the character that we're all playing, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.92,
      "end": 99.0,
      "text": "Not the human being that was born."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.0,
      "end": 100.76,
      "text": "Anytime you receive income,"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.76,
      "end": 102.86,
      "text": "you're gonna pay taxes."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.86,
      "end": 104.5,
      "text": "So how do we get away from that?"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.5,
      "end": 105.74,
      "text": "You have a private trust"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.74,
      "end": 107.7,
      "text": "that can own everything that you can own."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.7,
      "end": 109.9,
      "text": "It has all the same rights that you do."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.9,
      "end": 111.44,
      "text": "It can open a bank account,"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.44,
      "end": 113.38,
      "text": "it can open up an account at Schwab,"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.38,
      "end": 114.9,
      "text": "it can buy stocks,"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.9,
      "end": 115.74,
      "text": "it can buy crypto,"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.74,
      "end": 116.58,
      "text": "it can buy land,"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.58,
      "end": 117.42,
      "text": "it can buy real estate,"
    },
    {
      "start": 117.42,
      "end": 118.7,
      "text": "it can do Airbnb."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.7,
      "end": 121.14,
      "text": "It can do everything that you can do,"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.14,
      "end": 122.62,
      "text": "meaning it can own property,"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.62,
      "end": 123.62,
      "text": "it can own your home,"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.62,
      "end": 125.18,
      "text": "it can own your business."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.18,
      "end": 126.93,
      "text": "Here's the difference."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.93,
      "end": 128.61,
      "text": "When you have a private trust"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.61,
      "end": 132.45,
      "text": "that was created outside of the legislative system,"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.45,
      "end": 133.77,
      "text": "the Supreme Court has ruled"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.77,
      "end": 135.13,
      "text": "that the legislative system"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.13,
      "end": 139.05,
      "text": "has no legal authority over a private trust,"
    },
    {
      "start": 139.05,
      "end": 141.69,
      "text": "especially when there is no owner."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.69,
      "end": 143.25,
      "text": "We have a non-grantor trust,"
    },
    {
      "start": 143.25,
      "end": 145.25,
      "text": "which means the law firm resigns"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.25,
      "end": 146.69,
      "text": "after the trust is created,"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.69,
      "end": 149.37,
      "text": "meaning there is no owner on the trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.37,
      "end": 150.69,
      "text": "So now if I wanna sue you,"
    },
    {
      "start": 150.69,
      "end": 152.13,
      "text": "I can't get to your trust"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.13,
      "end": 155.01,
      "text": "because you don't own the trust anymore."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.01,
      "end": 157.05,
      "text": "You guys get what I'm saying?"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.05,
      "end": 158.13,
      "text": "You're the problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 158.13,
      "end": 159.29,
      "text": "We are the problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.29,
      "end": 160.69,
      "text": "This is why the Rockefeller said,"
    },
    {
      "start": 160.69,
      "end": 163.49,
      "text": "own nothing but control everything, control."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.49,
      "end": 165.81,
      "text": "Wealthy people control, they do not own."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.81,
      "end": 166.81,
      "text": "This is why Donald Trump"
    },
    {
      "start": 166.81,
      "end": 168.89,
      "text": "does not take the presidential pay."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.89,
      "end": 170.73,
      "text": "Because then he would own that income,"
    },
    {
      "start": 170.73,
      "end": 172.21,
      "text": "he would be receiving personal income,"
    },
    {
      "start": 172.25,
      "end": 174.21,
      "text": "and he would have to pay taxes."
    },
    {
      "start": 174.21,
      "end": 175.65,
      "text": "Think about this, folks."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.65,
      "end": 176.49,
      "text": "Love you all."
    }
